    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d446-f1" n="87" type="source" xml:id="d446-f1-content">
                <p>Copy transmitted to the Department by the Ambassador in China in his despatch No.
                    3092, October 25; received November 14.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d446-f2" n="88" xml:id="d446-f2-content">
                <p>Also known as Chin Pang-hsien, who returned to China in 1932 at the behest of
                    Stalin, then Secretary General of the Communist Party of the Soviet Union.</p>
            </note>
